- **Write:** batch-write via `DeepDiveStore.write_batch`. Emit `job_phase`/`job_progress` (`ops/job_progress.py`) every 250 tickers.
- `DeepDiveBatchResult` reports `tickers_computed`, `tickers_skipped`; include a `to_dict()`.

